{"id":"e_lectricite_","lemma":"électricité","pos":"noun","rank":2214,"glosses":["electricity"],"ipa":"/e.lɛk.tʁi.si.te/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/42/Fr-%C3%A9lectricit%C3%A9.ogg/Fr-%C3%A9lectricit%C3%A9.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"électricités"},"formAudio":{"électricités":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/40/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-%C3%A9lectricit%C3%A9s.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous ne pouvons pas travailler sans électricité.","en":"We can't work without electricity.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to work"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"L'électricité est fort utile.","en":"Electricity is very useful.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"strongly"},{"g":"useful"}]},{"text":"Après quelques minutes, l'électricité est revenue.","en":"After a few minutes, the electricity came back on.","words":[{"g":"after"},{"g":"some","l":"quelque"},{"g":"minute","l":"minute"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a return"}]},{"text":"Il me faut davantage d'électricité.","en":"I need more power.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to need","l":"falloir"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Je ne peux pas imaginer vivre sans électricité.","en":"I can't imagine living without electricity.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to imagine"},{"g":"to live"},{"g":"without"},null]}]}